#==============================================================================================
#
#   sri - SRI: Subresource Integrity's hash functions, parsing integrity metadata, getting
#   the strongest metadata and matching bytes against a metadata list
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/SRI/SRI.cpp (lines 1-191). The SHA-2 hashes are luce-crypto's
#       (LibCrypto's in C++). Ported by region p2e: the CSP checks parse integrity metadata,
#       and Fetch (region p2c) matches response bytes with it.
